== Auxiliary Shrines ==
In old times many subsidiary (sessha and massha) shrines were located both within and around the grounds, but presently all have been merged into the main shrine. The following describes the situation before the merger.

=== Within the Shrine Grounds ===
Until the fire in January {{ill|1876|ja|1876|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/1876|qq=}}, the following subsidiary shrines (with their principal deities) were enshrined on the grounds:
; Sessha
* {{ill|Sumiyoshi Shrine|ja|住吉神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sumiyoshi Shrine|qq=}} (deities: {{ill|Sumeru no Mikoto|ja|住吉三神|lt=Sumeru deities|lt_ja=表筒男命・中筒男命・底筒男命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sumeru no Mikoto|qq=}})
: Formerly known as “Mitarai-sha,” this shrine—located by a pond called Izumigashira—was enshrined as a guardian of the pond. (In the early Meiji period the enshrined deity was changed to {{ill|Ōwatatsumi no Mikoto|ja|大綿津見命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ōwatatsumi no Mikoto|qq=}}.)
; Massha
* {{ill|Kasuga-taisha|lt=Kasuga-taisha|lt=Kasuga Shrine|ja|春日神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kasuga Shrine|qq=}} ({{ill|Ame-no-Koyane|ja|天児屋根命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ame-no-Koyane-no-Mikoto|qq=}})
* {{ill|Kumano Shrine|ja|熊野神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kumano Shrine|qq=}} ({{ill|Izanami|ja|伊邪那美命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Izanami|qq=}})
* {{ill|Suga Shrine|ja|須賀神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Suga Shrine|qq=}} ({{ill|Susanoo-no-Mikoto|ja|須佐之男命|lt=Susanoo-no-Mikoto|lt_ja=須佐之男之命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Susanoo-no-Mikoto|qq=}})
* {{ill|Kotokoronoshi Shrine|ja|事代神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kotokoronoshi Shrine|qq=}} ({{ill|Kotoshironushi|ja|事代主命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kotoshironushi|qq=}})
* {{ill|Hikawa Shrine|ja|氷川神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Hikawa Shrine|qq=}} ({{ill|Kensoku Susanoo-no-Mikoto|ja|健速須佐之男命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kensoku Susanoo-no-Mikoto|qq=}})
* {{ill|Hachiman shrine|lt=Hachiman shrine|lt=Hachiman Shrine|ja|八幡神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Hachiman Shrine|qq=}} ({{ill|Emperor Ōjin|ja|応神天皇|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Emperor Ōjin|qq=}})
* {{ill|Asama Shrine|ja|浅間神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Asama Shrine|qq=}} ({{ill|Konohanasakuya-hime|ja|木花咲耶姫命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Konohanasakuya-hime|qq=}})
* {{ill|Ichikishima Shrines|lt=Ichikishima Shrines|lt=Ichikishima Shrine|ja|市杵嶋神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ichikishima Shrine|qq=}} ({{ill|Ichikishima-hime|ja|市杵島姫命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ichikishima-hime|qq=}})
* {{ill|Suwa Shrine|ja|諏訪神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Suwa Shrine|qq=}} ({{ill|Tatemikata-no-Kami|ja|建御名方神|lt=Kenmi-no-Kata|lt_ja=健御名方神|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Tatemikata-no-Kami|qq=}})
* {{ill|Tenman Shrine|ja|天満神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Tenman Shrine|qq=}} ({{ill|Sugawara no Michizane|ja|Sugawara no Michizane|lt=Sugawara Daijin|lt_ja=菅原大神|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sugawara no Michizane|qq=}})
