* {{ill|Ichikishima Shrines|lt=Ichikishima Shrines|lt=Ichikishima Shrine|ja|市杵嶋神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ichikishima Shrine|qq=}} ({{ill|Ichikishima-hime|ja|市杵島姫命|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ichikishima-hime|qq=}})
* {{ill|Suwa Shrine|ja|諏訪神社|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Suwa Shrine|qq=}} ({{ill|Tatemikata-no-Kami|ja|建御名方神|1=Takeminakata|2=ja|3=タケミナカタ|lt=Takeminakata|lt=Kenmi-no-Kata|lt_ja=健御名方神|qq=draft|qq=draft|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Tatemikata-no-Kami|qq=}})
